WEBVTT

01:36.640 --> 01:39.979
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.090 --> 01:41.870
[Episode 22]

01:42.860 --> 01:45.150
Radio Beijing,

01:45.150 --> 01:47.220
Traffic Radio.

01:47.400 --> 01:49.460
Sorry, there was a bit of a traffic jam.

01:50.890 --> 01:52.020
Where are the employees?

01:52.940 --> 01:55.470
We didn't dare to be idle even though you hadn't arrived.

01:55.490 --> 01:57.420
You told us yourself that

01:57.440 --> 01:58.080
even without subsidies,

01:58.110 --> 01:59.430
you could increase the market share

01:59.450 --> 02:00.770
to 50%.

02:00.790 --> 02:01.810
We'll definitely fully cooperate

02:01.830 --> 02:03.350
with such a good plan.

02:03.470 --> 02:04.710
Therefore, before you arrived,

02:04.710 --> 02:06.590
I'd already notified the chiefs of each station

02:06.610 --> 02:08.750
and the managers of each business line

02:08.860 --> 02:09.630
to come down there

02:09.669 --> 02:11.850
and get ready to be lectured by you anytime.

02:11.930 --> 02:13.250
If you have any thoughts,

02:13.270 --> 02:14.660
you can tell us in advance.

02:14.700 --> 02:16.750
We can discuss it internally first.

02:16.780 --> 02:18.010
There's no need for discussion.

02:18.680 --> 02:19.990
Before coming here,

02:20.190 --> 02:21.190
we've already used big data

02:21.230 --> 02:22.310
to do a convergence.

02:22.350 --> 02:24.670
Starting tomorrow, we'll adjust the delivery time.

02:24.700 --> 02:26.140
Each order's delivery time will be shortened by eight minutes.

02:26.160 --> 02:27.160
After the adjustment,

02:27.220 --> 02:28.720
the commission will increase.

02:28.760 --> 02:29.530
I've calculated it.

02:29.550 --> 02:31.490
The average commission per order can reach six yuan.

02:32.420 --> 02:33.660
That's wishful thinking.

02:33.750 --> 02:35.200
The profit of the food delivery business

02:35.230 --> 02:36.520
is already very low,

02:36.550 --> 02:38.390
yet he wants to increase the commission for delivery riders.

02:38.410 --> 02:39.520
So I want to ask,

02:39.560 --> 02:41.250
what money will the company be making?

02:41.470 --> 02:42.470
I've already discussed this with

02:42.470 --> 02:43.910
the technical department.

02:44.220 --> 02:46.110
The delivery time will be adjusted from 50 minutes

02:46.190 --> 02:47.590
to 42 minutes.

02:48.040 --> 02:49.590
That's two minutes shorter than Yuntu's.

02:49.650 --> 02:50.940
If everything goes as planned,

02:50.970 --> 02:52.540
the order volume will increase significantly.

02:52.560 --> 02:54.750
Even if we increase the commission for delivery riders,

02:54.790 --> 02:56.070
the profit won't decrease.

02:56.790 --> 02:58.829
Don't blame me for not telling you then.

02:59.150 --> 03:00.560
The original 50-minute delivery time

03:00.560 --> 03:01.990
was already wearing the riders out.

03:01.990 --> 03:04.030
Now you want to compress it to 42 minutes.

03:04.310 --> 03:05.550
If you really dare to do this,

03:06.110 --> 03:07.020
it will cost lives.

03:07.040 --> 03:08.170
You don't make the call here.

03:09.930 --> 03:11.220
Let's hear everyone's opinion.

03:24.270 --> 03:26.680
50 minutes changed to 42 minutes?

03:27.000 --> 03:28.510
How could we possibly manage that?

03:28.550 --> 03:30.520
Do they want us to die?

03:32.930 --> 03:34.230
How can they do that?

03:34.270 --> 03:35.480
This is pure bullying.

03:35.560 --> 03:36.350
They're pushing us too far.

03:36.390 --> 03:37.480
Exactly.

03:39.190 --> 03:40.270
There's no justice at all.

03:40.310 --> 03:40.750
Everyone.

03:40.750 --> 03:42.550
Why should we work hard from dawn to dusk?

03:42.570 --> 03:43.900
Everyone!

03:43.350 --> 03:50.450
[Service Counter]

03:46.350 --> 03:47.960
We all came to work in the food delivery industry

03:48.660 --> 03:50.590
with the initial intention of making money, right?

03:50.630 --> 03:52.030
Who doesn't want to make money?

03:52.030 --> 03:53.550
But if we work like that, we'll risk our lives.

03:53.550 --> 03:54.790
Who are we making all the money for then?

03:54.820 --> 03:55.579
Right?

03:55.630 --> 03:56.770
Yes, indeed.

04:02.510 --> 04:03.420
Before,

04:04.020 --> 04:05.380
for each order delivered,

04:05.780 --> 04:07.500
the commission was 5.9 yuan.

04:08.070 --> 04:10.360
If you take 30 to 40 orders a day,

04:10.380 --> 04:11.930
you'll make a bit over 200 yuan per day.

04:11.960 --> 04:13.770
That's only seven or eight thousand a month.

04:14.540 --> 04:17.060
After paying rent, utilities,

04:17.220 --> 04:18.810
and various other expenses,

04:18.970 --> 04:20.250
everyone, calculate in your mind,

04:20.279 --> 04:22.210
how much can you have left?

04:22.670 --> 04:23.500
Is that enough?

04:28.430 --> 04:29.450
After the adjustment,

04:30.370 --> 04:32.680
the workload will definitely increase,

04:33.000 --> 04:34.800
but once things get running smoothly,

04:34.830 --> 04:36.190
I believe each of you

04:36.230 --> 04:37.670
can earn over 10,000 yuan per month.

04:39.260 --> 04:41.330
You can do the math yourselves.

04:42.590 --> 04:44.000
I believe no one

04:44.030 --> 04:45.850
would turn down more money, right?

04:48.790 --> 04:50.510
That's true.

04:50.600 --> 04:52.360
Who would go against money?

04:52.360 --> 04:53.750
If we can earn over 10,000 a month,

04:53.750 --> 04:55.170
even if it'll be a bit tiring, it's acceptable.

04:56.590 --> 04:57.450
Besides,

04:58.270 --> 05:00.320
the distribution station will change the way of settlement.

05:00.340 --> 05:01.780
As soon as each order is delivered,

05:01.820 --> 05:04.900
half of your commission will be deposited into your account.

05:04.980 --> 05:06.480
The rest will be settled at the end of the month.

05:08.060 --> 05:09.650
How much you've earned each day

05:09.670 --> 05:11.250
can be easily checked on your phone.

05:11.290 --> 05:12.170
From now on,

05:11.390 --> 05:16.270
[Service Counter]

05:12.200 --> 05:14.550
there won't be any more labor disputes.

05:28.480 --> 05:30.490
If you're okay with this,

05:31.360 --> 05:33.120
we'll implement it from now on.

05:33.380 --> 05:34.370
Also,

05:34.540 --> 05:36.550
I need a lot more delivery riders.

05:36.570 --> 05:38.520
Please spread the word.

05:38.690 --> 05:41.340
If any of your friends or family members want to work in food delivery,

05:41.370 --> 05:42.980
tell them to come to Bee.

05:43.250 --> 05:45.340
Let's all make money together.

05:46.570 --> 05:47.960
Moreover,

05:48.340 --> 05:50.670
the person with the highest delivery quota each month

05:51.150 --> 05:54.090
will receive an additional 10,000 yuan cash bonus from the company.

06:02.200 --> 06:03.010
Alright.

06:03.710 --> 06:05.610
I won't keep you from making money any longer.

06:05.710 --> 06:06.500
Hit the road!

06:06.500 --> 06:07.950
Great!

06:09.870 --> 06:12.330
[Kejing Garden]

06:19.630 --> 06:22.950
[Kejing Garden]

06:31.890 --> 06:32.570
Come in.

06:35.390 --> 06:36.270
What's up?

06:36.860 --> 06:37.590
Fenghua.

06:38.030 --> 06:38.740
There's something I want to tell you.

06:38.950 --> 06:40.080
I've been thinking about it,

06:40.110 --> 06:41.310
and I believe I should tell you.

06:41.990 --> 06:42.550
Go ahead.

06:42.570 --> 06:43.750
You asked me

06:43.750 --> 06:44.890
to have more heart-to-heart talks with everyone, right?

06:44.930 --> 06:45.760
I did.

06:45.870 --> 06:46.870
And today, they told me

06:46.900 --> 06:49.220
there's a company trying to poach people everywhere.

06:49.830 --> 06:50.870
Which company?

06:51.140 --> 06:51.990
Bee.

06:52.010 --> 06:53.190
They said it's a big company

06:53.320 --> 06:54.440
with headquarters in Beijing.

06:54.890 --> 06:56.120
They're offering higher salaries.

06:57.870 --> 06:58.710
How much higher than ours?

06:59.100 --> 07:00.030
They didn't say.

07:00.580 --> 07:01.720
But it seems to me that

07:02.000 --> 07:03.440
Liu is interested.

07:04.950 --> 07:06.190
That can't be.

07:06.210 --> 07:08.140
Liu was one of our first employees.

07:08.160 --> 07:09.390
We've been through tough times together.

07:09.850 --> 07:11.370
I'm not worried about his loyalty.

07:11.480 --> 07:13.360
I'm just worried the pay difference might be too big.

07:18.270 --> 07:19.060
Alright.

07:19.200 --> 07:19.990
I see.

07:21.080 --> 07:22.670
Keep a close eye on things these days,

07:22.690 --> 07:24.040
especially on their methods.

07:24.070 --> 07:25.050
Find out everything you can.

07:25.160 --> 07:25.890
I'll do my best.

07:26.550 --> 07:27.570
I'll be off then.

07:37.050 --> 07:39.500
[Bee Delivery
Xie Wanghe]

07:40.870 --> 07:43.090
You just can't help bullying me, can you?

07:44.030 --> 07:46.190
I'll beat you to death.

07:44.170 --> 07:45.440
[Bee Delivery
Xie Wanghe]

07:50.350 --> 07:51.250
Hello.

07:51.670 --> 07:52.970
Hello.

07:53.150 --> 07:55.030
Did you receive the lotus root?

07:55.060 --> 07:56.260
Yes, I did.

07:56.350 --> 07:56.950
Even though you sent it to me,

07:56.950 --> 07:58.540
I don't have time to cook.

07:58.540 --> 07:59.770
Just give some to Wanghe and the others.

07:59.800 --> 08:01.590
You should invite Wanghe and the others over

08:01.590 --> 08:02.990
for dinner and drinks more often, just like when you were kids.

08:02.990 --> 08:04.070
How happy would that be.

08:04.880 --> 08:05.690
They

08:05.960 --> 08:07.360
are even busier than I am.

08:07.390 --> 08:09.390
We rarely have the chance to meet up these days.

08:10.990 --> 08:11.740
Well, um,

08:11.770 --> 08:12.470
daughter,

08:12.510 --> 08:13.350
listen.

08:13.370 --> 08:15.730
Has Wanghe been promoted?

08:15.820 --> 08:17.270
I heard from his father that

08:17.270 --> 08:18.830
his monthly salary now

08:19.130 --> 08:20.340
is over ten thousand.

08:20.670 --> 08:24.180
For a top university graduate, earning over ten thousand is considered low.

08:24.640 --> 08:26.630
How much do you earn per month now?

08:27.590 --> 08:28.700
Why do you care?

08:28.720 --> 08:31.240
Anyway, I'll give you a big red envelope when I come back home for the New Year.

08:31.270 --> 08:32.200
Don't worry.

08:32.620 --> 08:33.669
If there's nothing else, I'll hang up now.

08:33.710 --> 08:34.470
Don't hang up yet.

08:34.620 --> 08:36.820
You know Mr. Shao from our neighborhood, right?

08:36.840 --> 08:38.159
He has a classmate in Beijing

08:38.190 --> 08:38.789
whose son

08:38.830 --> 08:40.429
is a graduate from a prestigious university.

08:40.690 --> 08:42.390
Your mother and I have seen his photo.

08:42.390 --> 08:43.590
That young man looks handsome.

08:43.590 --> 08:44.430
Really handsome, I mean.

08:50.160 --> 08:51.680
What did I tell you?

08:51.830 --> 08:53.350
Fenghua is

08:53.390 --> 08:54.950
developing her own career in Beijing now.

08:54.980 --> 08:56.570
How could she have time for dating?

08:56.630 --> 08:58.110
But she can't stay single forever.

08:58.130 --> 08:58.920
She's not young anymore.

08:58.990 --> 08:59.990
So what?

09:00.020 --> 09:01.400
People nowadays value

09:01.430 --> 09:02.990
women's independence and autonomy.

09:03.020 --> 09:04.580
Women should have their own careers.

09:04.610 --> 09:05.570
I think Fenghua has been doing pretty good

09:05.590 --> 09:07.230
in Beijing these past couple of years.

09:07.260 --> 09:08.770
She's never mentioned wanting to come back home.

09:08.950 --> 09:10.860
Let's not hold her back.

09:10.890 --> 09:12.180
What do you mean by holding her back?

09:12.200 --> 09:13.560
Why is this holding her back?

09:13.630 --> 09:16.110
Not getting married at this age is what's holding her back.

09:16.130 --> 09:18.010
With your limited perspective,

09:18.680 --> 09:21.030
if I hadn't been held back by you, old man,

09:21.070 --> 09:22.580
I would have gone to Beijing too.

09:22.610 --> 09:24.930
I could have ventured out like Fenghua does.

09:24.960 --> 09:26.760
Maybe I'd be a rich lady by now.

09:26.790 --> 09:27.990
I'd have a lot of money.

09:28.010 --> 09:29.130
Not just money,

09:29.500 --> 09:30.670
you've got issues too.

10:12.960 --> 10:15.520
Everyone who left his or her hometown to work in Beijing

10:15.940 --> 10:17.150
[Zhongguancun Station]

10:16.150 --> 10:18.810
has imagined such a scene.

10:18.920 --> 10:21.740
That is when your bank account gets credited,

10:21.810 --> 10:23.240
[Delicious food delivery riders wanted
Monthly salary over 10,000]

10:21.870 --> 10:24.140
you can buy a car for your father,

10:24.550 --> 10:26.650
a bracelet for your mother,

10:27.380 --> 10:30.890
and clear out your girlfriend's shopping cart.

10:28.180 --> 10:35.580
[High Salary] [More Work, More Pay] [Commission per Order]

10:31.350 --> 10:32.150
Am I right?

10:32.170 --> 10:33.310
Yes.

10:34.150 --> 10:35.670
Why did we come to Beijing?

10:36.330 --> 10:38.240
Because Beijing offers more opportunities.

10:38.660 --> 10:41.130
Beijing can help us realize our dreams.

10:42.680 --> 10:44.270
We all hope that one day,

10:44.350 --> 10:45.970
we can settle down here,

10:46.070 --> 10:47.440
establish our careers here,

10:47.320 --> 10:53.170
[Delicious food delivery riders wanted
Monthly salary over 10,000, no upper limit]

10:47.590 --> 10:49.470
and achieve success here.

10:50.770 --> 10:52.240
Do you want to be successful?

10:52.310 --> 10:53.270
Yes.

10:53.350 --> 10:54.430
Do you want to be successful?

10:54.480 --> 10:55.990
Yes!

10:56.210 --> 10:58.460
[Letter of Resignation]

10:56.690 --> 10:57.710
Have you thought it through?

10:58.340 --> 11:00.600
I'm sorry. If my family hadn't built a new house,

11:00.670 --> 11:02.590
I wouldn't choose to quit no matter how much money they offer.

11:03.470 --> 11:04.910
How much more do you need for the new house?

11:04.950 --> 11:06.360
I can lend it to you, no problem.

11:06.540 --> 11:07.610
No... No need.

11:09.630 --> 11:11.000
So it's not about the money?

11:13.110 --> 11:15.890
It is about the money. They're offering more.

11:15.930 --> 11:16.730
How much more?

11:18.240 --> 11:19.510
I'm asking you.

11:20.970 --> 11:23.420
I think our small-scale operation

11:23.450 --> 11:25.040
is bound to fail sooner or later.

11:25.070 --> 11:26.480
Are you looking down on me

11:26.550 --> 11:27.870
or yourself?

11:28.700 --> 11:29.740
We may be poor,

11:29.760 --> 11:30.960
and our scale may be small,

11:30.990 --> 11:32.560
but we have more experience.

11:32.580 --> 11:34.060
We're also more efficient at work.

11:34.140 --> 11:35.550
Look at those companies that just grab money

11:35.550 --> 11:36.590
and burn through it recklessly.

11:36.590 --> 11:38.540
How many of them have gone bankrupt over the years?

11:38.570 --> 11:39.970
Just last year, one company...

11:40.000 --> 11:41.520
I'm sorry. Please take care.

11:51.520 --> 11:55.260
Fenghua Express is recruiting couriers.

11:52.500 --> 11:56.150
[Fenghua Express Recruiting Couriers]

11:55.290 --> 11:56.840
Are you two interested, girls?

11:58.010 --> 11:59.030
Hey, you two.

11:59.070 --> 11:59.990
Want to be couriers?

12:00.010 --> 12:01.230
No.

12:01.270 --> 12:02.530
We offer competitive salaries and benefits.

12:05.710 --> 12:07.500
We're sincerely recruiting couriers.

12:08.870 --> 12:10.180
Hey, young man.

12:10.440 --> 12:11.530
Interested in being a courier?

12:11.550 --> 12:13.060
We have plenty of work but little hassle at our station.

12:13.110 --> 12:15.060
Our conditions are unique in all of Haidian.

12:15.110 --> 12:15.940
Your conditions are

12:15.990 --> 12:17.390
pretty much the same as other companies.

12:17.440 --> 12:19.010
We also provide lunch.

12:19.070 --> 12:19.800
That's it?

12:20.520 --> 12:21.840
Three meat dishes and one vegetable dish.

12:21.860 --> 12:23.620
Why don't you give it more thought?

12:21.960 --> 12:23.440
[Fenghua Express Recruiting Couriers]

12:32.150 --> 12:35.230
We're not hiring delivery riders,

12:35.350 --> 12:37.090
but dreamers.

12:38.690 --> 12:39.930
Bee Group

12:40.250 --> 12:45.550
[Delivery Riders Wanted]

12:40.910 --> 12:43.920
is willing to give everyone a chance to realize their dreams.

12:44.030 --> 12:45.750
As long as you're willing to work hard,

12:45.800 --> 12:47.620
earning over 10,000 a month is not a dream.

12:47.710 --> 12:48.950
Great!

12:55.640 --> 12:57.530
Those who want to join Bee,

12:57.890 --> 12:59.510
let's talk one by one.

13:00.110 --> 13:03.660
[Delivery Riders Wanted]

13:00.920 --> 13:01.830
Alright, give it to me. Give it to me.

13:01.830 --> 13:03.590
No rush, no rush.

13:05.830 --> 13:06.550
Alright. Come on.

13:06.550 --> 13:07.460
Give it to me.

13:20.450 --> 13:22.620
I finally get to treat you to a meal.

13:22.650 --> 13:24.530
Couldn't you have picked a more proper restaurant?

13:25.560 --> 13:27.100
How is this place not proper?

13:27.120 --> 13:28.680
It's so down-to-earth.

13:28.980 --> 13:29.890
Alright, alright.

13:29.960 --> 13:31.030
Just eat more.

13:31.070 --> 13:32.020
Eat until you're stuffed.

13:38.380 --> 13:39.580
How many people did you recruit today?

13:42.630 --> 13:43.750
Zero.

13:44.620 --> 13:45.780
When it comes to recruiting,

13:46.280 --> 13:47.560
you need to have some skills.

13:47.590 --> 13:49.510
Just handing out flyers won't work.

13:51.610 --> 13:53.300
No skills will work.

13:53.320 --> 13:54.550
The wages we offer are too low.

13:54.580 --> 13:56.180
We can't compete with you guys.

13:56.210 --> 13:59.340
To grab market share, you have to burn some money.

13:59.560 --> 14:03.130
Yuntu and Eat Well haven't been shy about burning money either, right?

14:03.190 --> 14:05.160
Does your company plan to keep burning money like this?

14:05.170 --> 14:07.010
We're burning the least amount of money.

14:07.050 --> 14:08.720
This time, we don't want to compete on price.

14:09.160 --> 14:10.120
So what are you competing on?

14:10.150 --> 14:10.910
Speed.

14:12.330 --> 14:14.910
We're significantly reducing delivery time

14:15.350 --> 14:16.470
and increasing commissions.

14:16.500 --> 14:17.650
Our delivery riders are all very hardworking.

14:19.160 --> 14:20.930
How can you shorten delivery time?

14:21.490 --> 14:22.850
There are many ways.

14:23.400 --> 14:25.590
Based on the real-time location of delivery riders,

14:25.610 --> 14:27.970
the system prioritizes orders by distance.

14:28.000 --> 14:28.800
After accepting an order,

14:28.830 --> 14:29.830
the system provides navigation

14:30.470 --> 14:31.820
to avoid congested routes.

14:31.850 --> 14:33.690
Doesn't that increase the speed?

14:33.720 --> 14:34.720
That's so advanced.

14:35.000 --> 14:37.180
Currently, it's only available in Haidian.

14:37.200 --> 14:39.430
Other areas can't realize it yet.

14:40.400 --> 14:42.130
But I feel that this alone

14:42.490 --> 14:43.690
won't make it much faster.

14:44.190 --> 14:46.680
There's more. The company will provide subsidies

14:47.250 --> 14:48.350
for the riders to buy motorcycles.

14:48.660 --> 14:50.180
The delivery speed will be faster.

14:50.660 --> 14:51.780
All they need to do is get a driver's license.

14:52.790 --> 14:53.780
Are you out of your mind?

14:54.350 --> 14:56.790
Riding a motorcycle at that speed can be fatal.

14:59.320 --> 15:01.470
It's just the initial idea.

15:01.510 --> 15:02.580
Why are you so worked up?

15:02.610 --> 15:03.930
You shouldn't even have such thoughts.

15:03.960 --> 15:05.250
If you really do this,

15:05.270 --> 15:06.470
don't say you know me anymore.

15:08.010 --> 15:08.740
Alright. Alright.

15:08.740 --> 15:09.710
Let's eat.

15:10.470 --> 15:11.230
Eat more.

15:25.190 --> 15:26.500
Is something on your mind?

15:28.220 --> 15:29.400
No, why?

15:29.430 --> 15:30.830
Then why do you look so worried?

15:30.850 --> 15:31.780
You're not even paying attention to me,

15:31.810 --> 15:33.130
just staring at your phone.

15:37.640 --> 15:38.890
Is this about that mixed-race girl?

15:40.500 --> 15:42.380
We've lost contact with her for years.

15:42.400 --> 15:43.650
Everyone's worried about her.

15:45.400 --> 15:47.000
Are you guys all secretly in love with her?

15:47.030 --> 15:48.200
I'm certainly not.

15:51.350 --> 15:52.720
What about Wanghe?

15:54.030 --> 15:55.060
He...

15:55.650 --> 15:56.410
He won't admit it.

15:56.910 --> 15:58.950
So Fenghua likes Wanghe.

15:59.670 --> 16:00.600
She won't admit it either.

16:02.660 --> 16:03.830
You're all crazy.

16:04.330 --> 16:06.560
Other people's youth is filled with passionate love,

16:06.580 --> 16:07.660
but you guys

16:07.690 --> 16:08.930
have all been bottling it up.

16:08.960 --> 16:10.600
Aren't you afraid it'll make you sick?

16:11.830 --> 16:12.740
You're right.

16:17.910 --> 16:19.130
Are you still mad at me?

16:19.930 --> 16:20.880
No, I'm not.

16:21.790 --> 16:23.220
Then why aren't you talking?

16:24.610 --> 16:25.610
I'm tired.

16:27.750 --> 16:29.220
If you're tired, take a rest.

16:29.610 --> 16:32.170
The competition among express delivery stations isn't as fierce now as before.

16:33.650 --> 16:35.720
As if you've worked in express delivery before.

16:36.740 --> 16:39.610
Every industry has its peak period.

16:39.630 --> 16:42.300
The express delivery industry has passed its peak.

16:42.470 --> 16:43.640
Staying stable is enough.

16:44.170 --> 16:45.350
We're different.

16:45.380 --> 16:47.760
We still need to grit our teeth and push forward.

16:48.180 --> 16:49.520
In the end,

16:49.680 --> 16:51.900
only a few companies will survive.

16:54.360 --> 16:55.200
It's okay.

16:55.230 --> 16:56.870
If your company fails,

16:56.890 --> 16:57.540
I'll take you in.

16:58.150 --> 16:59.660
Bah! God forbid.

17:00.750 --> 17:01.820
I'm telling you, this time,

17:01.860 --> 17:03.230
I'm putting everything on the line.

17:03.320 --> 17:05.150
It's do or die.

17:07.800 --> 17:09.030
In our senior year,

17:09.060 --> 17:10.750
when you and Haikuo were doing ground promotion,

17:10.829 --> 17:11.829
you said the same thing.

17:12.260 --> 17:13.410
You lost everything,

17:13.450 --> 17:14.750
but I didn't see you "die" then.

17:17.520 --> 17:19.819
Although we lost money that time,

17:19.839 --> 17:21.940
the boss saw my potential.

17:21.960 --> 17:23.380
That's why I am where I am today.

17:23.560 --> 17:25.069
So essentially, I didn't lose.

17:26.230 --> 17:27.450
But Haikuo did lose.

17:28.339 --> 17:29.710
He spent all that time and put in all that effort with you,

17:29.740 --> 17:30.970
and got nothing out of it.

17:31.110 --> 17:32.840
He almost missed his graduation defense.

17:33.870 --> 17:34.980
Did he tell you that?

17:36.240 --> 17:38.940
He's not the type to complain behind others' backs.

17:39.440 --> 17:40.750
Even though he didn't say anything,

17:40.750 --> 17:42.050
you should be aware of it.

17:42.080 --> 17:44.020
When you make it big in the future,

17:44.050 --> 17:45.320
these are all favors

17:45.350 --> 17:46.600
you'll need to repay gradually.

17:47.150 --> 17:48.020
Of course.

17:48.710 --> 17:50.050
Besides Haikuo and

17:50.290 --> 17:51.210
Xingchi,

17:52.020 --> 17:52.820
I need to repay you as well.

17:55.870 --> 17:57.190
You don't owe me anything.

17:57.230 --> 17:58.280
There's no need to repay any favors.

17:58.320 --> 17:59.120
I do owe you.

17:59.590 --> 18:00.480
A lot.

18:01.910 --> 18:02.560
For example?

18:04.590 --> 18:06.090
Think about it carefully.

18:06.260 --> 18:07.470
If you can't remember,

18:07.490 --> 18:08.540
then let's pretend I don't owe you anything.

18:16.160 --> 18:18.620
You're a big shot now.

18:19.150 --> 18:22.560
It's good to have drive when starting a business,

18:23.210 --> 18:25.230
but everything needs moderation.

18:25.430 --> 18:27.420
You need to leave yourself a way out.

18:28.000 --> 18:28.970
It's for your own good.

18:29.540 --> 18:30.620
Got it.

18:30.650 --> 18:32.710
Why are you even more nagging than my mom?

18:33.260 --> 18:34.660
I'll call you auntie from now on.

18:36.640 --> 18:38.340
Give it to me. I'm leaving.

18:39.880 --> 18:40.920
Be careful.

18:41.090 --> 18:42.170
Be safe.

18:41.190 --> 18:46.060
[Zhongguancun Station]

18:58.550 --> 19:00.340
I thought there was a burglar in the house.

19:00.610 --> 19:01.680
When did you get here?

19:02.170 --> 19:02.970
I just arrived.

19:03.220 --> 19:04.360
I brought you some scallops.

19:04.430 --> 19:05.440
I put them in the kitchen. Go cook them yourself.

19:05.470 --> 19:06.380
I've already eaten.

19:16.130 --> 19:17.220
You're in a bad mood, huh?

19:18.380 --> 19:19.090
No.

19:19.510 --> 19:20.820
Come on.

19:20.860 --> 19:21.930
I know you too well.

19:21.960 --> 19:22.880
What for?

19:26.690 --> 19:28.620
Just those annoying things at the company.

19:28.700 --> 19:29.820
I can't put up with it anymore.

19:30.240 --> 19:31.630
Then don't put up with it.

19:32.190 --> 19:33.310
Come work for me.

19:33.480 --> 19:34.910
I just started working at the Haidian branch.

19:34.990 --> 19:36.030
I'm short-staffed right now.

19:36.070 --> 19:36.910
Xingchi is coming too.

19:37.040 --> 19:38.070
Really?

19:38.090 --> 19:39.750
He's finally willing to work earnestly?

19:39.750 --> 19:41.030
Well, he's got to work.

19:42.610 --> 19:43.620
At the beginning,

19:43.900 --> 19:45.140
the salary won't be too high,

19:45.550 --> 19:47.280
but there will be bonuses if you do well.

19:47.570 --> 19:49.110
You'll definitely have to work harder,

19:49.140 --> 19:51.140
but the income won't be lower than what you're making now.

19:52.680 --> 19:55.970
What can a programmer like me do at a food delivery company?

19:55.990 --> 19:58.350
Bro, there's a lot to do.

19:58.750 --> 20:00.720
Food delivery also falls under the information and communication technology industry.

20:01.070 --> 20:01.790
Don't worry.

20:01.810 --> 20:03.450
Talent like yours won't go to waste.

20:03.470 --> 20:04.550
Let me think about it.

20:06.260 --> 20:07.090
Here's what you do.

20:07.580 --> 20:08.830
Take two days off first.

20:08.860 --> 20:10.450
Come and get a feel for my company.

20:10.490 --> 20:11.900
If it feels all right, you can come.

20:12.170 --> 20:13.810
If not, tell me

20:13.830 --> 20:15.330
why, and I'll make adjustments.

20:15.510 --> 20:18.200
If I can't adjust, you can go back to your company. Okay?

20:18.750 --> 20:19.510
Come on.

20:20.110 --> 20:21.480
So you're begging me?

20:21.700 --> 20:22.940
Go open that nice bottle of wine.

20:27.380 --> 20:29.080
Don't even think about touching my wine.

20:29.160 --> 20:30.030
This is serious business.

20:30.030 --> 20:31.070
Think it over carefully.

20:31.090 --> 20:32.150
I'll go take a shower.

20:32.180 --> 20:34.630
Why are you so stingy?

20:35.100 --> 20:36.070
I'm watching you.

20:38.870 --> 20:40.350
If you don't open it, I won't go.

20:49.010 --> 20:50.110
When are you leaving?

20:50.130 --> 20:51.130
In a few days.

20:51.580 --> 20:52.430
By high-speed rail.

20:55.060 --> 20:56.380
Here, this is for you.

20:57.390 --> 20:59.190
This is from your dad. He asked me to give it to you.

20:59.190 --> 21:00.790
I was busy the last couple of days and didn't get a chance to give it to you.

21:08.940 --> 21:11.460
Your dad is quite worried about you.

21:09.270 --> 21:14.650
[Ni Xiaozhou Bamboo Carving Art Museum]

21:12.770 --> 21:14.600
He wants you to go back as soon as possible.

21:16.220 --> 21:17.780
He's not worried about me.

21:19.240 --> 21:21.600
He's just worried that I'll embarrass him if something happens to me in Beijing.

21:24.980 --> 21:26.480
For the past two years,

21:26.760 --> 21:28.280
I've been studying the sunken ship with him, right?

21:28.320 --> 21:29.400
We spent quite a lot of time together.

21:29.700 --> 21:31.070
Every time he got drunk, he'd talk about you.

21:31.310 --> 21:32.070
What did he say?

21:32.510 --> 21:33.480
He said you're smart,

21:33.830 --> 21:35.040
and you learn everything very fast.

21:36.940 --> 21:38.800
He also said

21:38.910 --> 21:41.280
he deeply regretted not spending more time with you when you were in high school.

21:41.670 --> 21:43.090
That's why you got so rebellious.

21:43.190 --> 21:44.300
That's all nonsense.

21:45.770 --> 21:47.220
I learned a new word recently,

21:47.220 --> 21:47.910
called brainwashing.

21:47.910 --> 21:48.870
You know?

21:49.230 --> 21:50.950
He treats me and my mom the same way.

21:51.440 --> 21:53.510
Don't you think it's despicable

21:53.510 --> 21:54.430
to establish one's authority

21:54.470 --> 21:55.790
by undermining others' confidence?

21:56.270 --> 21:57.560
My mom is also like that.

21:58.590 --> 22:00.260
I didn't listen to her back then

22:00.310 --> 22:01.870
and went to Honghuai Normal University, right?

22:02.120 --> 22:05.050
Now I've graduated, but I haven't found a proper job.

22:05.070 --> 22:06.460
I didn't take the civil service exam either.

22:06.760 --> 22:07.930
My mom feels it's really embarrassing.

22:09.430 --> 22:12.070
She hasn't spoken to me in a long time.

22:14.770 --> 22:16.540
So what do you do every day now?

22:16.910 --> 22:19.660
I study the history and culture related to the canal.

22:19.700 --> 22:21.060
Have you made any achievements?

22:21.750 --> 22:23.630
Not much yet.

22:23.770 --> 22:26.810
But recently, Grandpa Zhou and I have been studying that sunken ship,

22:26.840 --> 22:27.920
and we've made some interesting discoveries.

22:28.100 --> 22:29.710
Why are you studying that stuff?

22:29.710 --> 22:30.830
Isn't that just a waste of time?

22:30.850 --> 22:32.370
How is it a waste of time?

22:32.430 --> 22:33.190
You know what?

22:33.190 --> 22:35.030
The owner of that ship was an Italian.

22:35.030 --> 22:37.490
He had a very interesting notebook.

22:37.530 --> 22:38.580
Let me show you.

22:42.500 --> 22:43.870
He had a group of followers.

22:43.900 --> 22:45.980
The translator was called Xie Pingyao.

22:46.000 --> 22:47.680
The porter was named Shao Changlai.

22:47.720 --> 22:49.120
The captain's surname was Xia.

22:49.160 --> 22:50.430
The sailor was called Zhou Yiyan.

22:50.460 --> 22:51.700
The bodyguard's surname was Gu.

22:52.900 --> 22:54.940
Don't you think that's quite a coincidence?

22:55.170 --> 22:57.950
Xie, Shao, Xia, and Zhou.

22:59.820 --> 23:02.520
After I get the original copy of the notebook tomorrow,

23:02.540 --> 23:03.710
if I can find out

23:03.750 --> 23:04.930
what that Italian's name was,

23:04.960 --> 23:07.130
I can follow the clues all the way up.

23:07.260 --> 23:08.980
Maybe their journey

23:09.010 --> 23:11.770
will one day unravel the connections between our families,

23:11.790 --> 23:14.400
and tie together these hundred-year-old threads.

23:14.430 --> 23:15.350
Gosh.

23:15.350 --> 23:17.260
It gives me goose bumps.

23:17.260 --> 23:18.700
Right? And think about it.

23:18.720 --> 23:20.870
Mr. Zhou has an Italian silver coin.

23:20.900 --> 23:22.940
My grandfather has an Italian-made dagger.

23:24.150 --> 23:25.860
Xie Wanghe's family has a wine flask.

23:25.900 --> 23:26.900
It's also made of silver.

23:26.910 --> 23:28.530
There's foreign writing on it.

23:29.100 --> 23:31.460
T-There's a shoehorn in my house.

23:31.870 --> 23:33.200
It also has foreign writing on it.

23:33.620 --> 23:35.380
Fenghua's family has a

23:36.160 --> 23:37.050
makeup mirror.

23:37.070 --> 23:38.030
It also has foreign writing on it.

23:38.030 --> 23:39.350
Y-You should check them all out.

23:39.350 --> 23:39.950
No problem.

23:39.980 --> 23:40.840
After I return, I'll go check them out.

23:40.880 --> 23:42.520
If they all have Italian writing on them,

23:42.540 --> 23:43.770
then we're on to something.

23:45.480 --> 23:48.410
Now you don't think it's a waste of time, do you?

23:49.190 --> 23:50.400
Oh my god.

23:50.870 --> 23:52.260
If you can really connect all these families

23:52.350 --> 23:53.630
together,

23:54.000 --> 23:55.640
you'll be doing a great service.

23:55.670 --> 23:57.670
I'll do my best.

23:58.460 --> 23:59.840
Good luck. Good luck.

24:01.670 --> 24:02.550
Be careful.

24:19.750 --> 24:21.800
This was the only page that I didn't print clearly at the time.

24:24.120 --> 24:25.530
Paul.

24:25.560 --> 24:26.460
Paul. D.

24:26.550 --> 24:28.300
A typical Italian name.

24:28.350 --> 24:30.670
So what does the D stand for?

24:31.540 --> 24:32.410
D...

24:33.460 --> 24:34.900
That's hard to say.

24:36.020 --> 24:38.640
But you can use the method of exhaustion

24:38.660 --> 24:40.940
to trace all surnames that start with D.

24:41.020 --> 24:42.780
Okay.

24:43.270 --> 24:44.960
I remember he mentioned in his diary

24:45.030 --> 24:46.320
a place named Verona.

24:46.580 --> 24:47.900
Verona?

24:49.530 --> 24:51.000
That makes it easier to search.

24:51.030 --> 24:52.750
You can contact the local authorities in Verona

24:52.750 --> 24:54.090
and ask them to help you with the research.

24:54.450 --> 24:55.440
Yes, right.

24:55.480 --> 24:56.240
Think about it.

24:56.790 --> 24:58.210
In that era,

24:58.630 --> 25:01.080
he was able to travel across the ocean

25:01.700 --> 25:03.990
and afford so many attendants.

25:04.500 --> 25:05.780
This indicates that he was

25:05.780 --> 25:07.430
from a wealthy family there.

25:08.240 --> 25:10.220
Italy's historical records of the nobility,

25:10.220 --> 25:13.950
especially their family history, are relatively well-preserved.

25:14.090 --> 25:16.070
I think it should be easy to trace.

25:16.090 --> 25:16.690
Great.

25:16.730 --> 25:17.900
I'll send an email

25:17.900 --> 25:19.440
to the local cultural authorities when I get back.

25:19.460 --> 25:20.090
Okay.

25:38.890 --> 25:44.200
[Flower Street Boys]

25:43.230 --> 25:44.060
Everyone.

25:44.260 --> 25:45.350
I know you're all busy.

25:45.380 --> 25:46.490
I'm heading back home.

25:46.700 --> 25:48.710
Later, I'll start a WeChat public account

25:48.740 --> 25:49.980
called "Chronicles of Flower Street".

25:50.030 --> 25:52.390
The content will be about the canal and that sunken ship.

25:52.410 --> 25:53.430
Please stay tuned.

26:05.570 --> 26:07.910
-Mr. Zhou! Mr. Zhou!
-Mr. Zhou!

26:08.990 --> 26:09.630
Here.

26:11.940 --> 26:12.770
Mr. Zhou!

26:13.150 --> 26:14.790
Chen Rui has some news.

26:14.900 --> 26:15.780
Really?

26:23.850 --> 26:26.680
That Professor Su from Beijing

26:27.070 --> 26:29.300
found the original copy of the notebook.

26:29.340 --> 26:32.370
And Chen Rui found the ship owner's signature

26:32.410 --> 26:35.730
on the cover of that original.

26:37.130 --> 26:39.220
Paul. D.

26:42.110 --> 26:43.150
Little Polo.

26:43.150 --> 26:43.790
Right.

26:43.870 --> 26:45.490
It's Little Polo.

26:48.660 --> 26:50.590
This is great!

26:50.590 --> 26:51.730
Now we know his real identity.

26:51.770 --> 26:52.770
That makes things easier.

26:52.790 --> 26:53.670
Chen Rui

26:53.700 --> 26:56.380
has written to the Italian Ministry of Culture,

26:56.400 --> 26:58.330
hoping to learn more.

26:58.500 --> 26:59.610
If everything goes well,

26:59.700 --> 27:01.010
it won't be long

27:01.030 --> 27:02.740
before we know Little Polo's

27:02.780 --> 27:04.160
entire life story.

27:04.200 --> 27:05.940
Great. That's great.

27:10.330 --> 27:11.700
Ah, Little Polo.

27:12.430 --> 27:13.630
Your story

27:14.250 --> 27:16.880
is about to surface.

27:17.660 --> 27:18.780
That's wonderful.

27:21.610 --> 27:22.600
Wonderful.

27:23.600 --> 27:24.790
Be careful.

27:27.350 --> 27:28.780
There's no need to be nervous.

27:28.910 --> 27:29.760
Let me tell you.

27:29.790 --> 27:32.750
Mr. Zhou is a very kind and genuine person.

27:32.780 --> 27:34.610
You are such a nice and decent person.

27:34.640 --> 27:36.000
There won't be any problem.

27:36.960 --> 27:37.800
He might

27:37.820 --> 27:40.250
just be a bit quiet.

27:40.300 --> 27:41.790
If there's a lull in the conversation later,

27:41.520 --> 27:49.640
[By the Canal]

27:41.840 --> 27:43.340
you need to find a topic to talk about.

27:43.600 --> 27:45.990
So what is he interested in?

27:46.570 --> 27:48.070
Food, I suppose.

27:48.110 --> 27:50.150
He's a famous master of Huaiyang cuisine.

27:50.150 --> 27:51.370
He's been cooking his whole life.

27:51.400 --> 27:52.680
He's well-known far and wide.

27:52.720 --> 27:54.480
He even made it on TV a couple of years ago.

27:54.500 --> 27:55.430
Is that so?

27:56.050 --> 27:56.700
You've arrived.

27:57.200 --> 27:58.450
Come on, let me introduce.

27:58.480 --> 28:01.040
This is Mr. Zhou, Zhou Yanlin.

28:01.060 --> 28:01.790
Hello.

28:01.810 --> 28:02.240
Hello.

28:02.260 --> 28:03.540
Ms. Bian, right?

28:03.920 --> 28:04.620
Yes.

28:05.850 --> 28:06.880
Well...

28:07.430 --> 28:08.390
Well... Well...

28:08.900 --> 28:09.430
Well,

28:10.990 --> 28:12.110
go inside.

28:12.720 --> 28:13.410
Okay.

28:14.600 --> 28:16.490
Let's go. Please, come in.

28:17.410 --> 28:22.950
[By the Canal]

28:20.230 --> 28:21.480
Alright. Alright.

28:23.260 --> 28:23.820
So...

28:23.840 --> 28:24.830
Ms. Bian,

28:25.690 --> 28:26.760
have some tea.

28:31.720 --> 28:32.510
Thank you.

28:32.510 --> 28:33.410
Please, have some tea.

28:41.510 --> 28:44.280
Ms. Bian, which high school are you teaching in?

28:44.770 --> 28:46.010
No. 7 High School.

28:46.220 --> 28:47.310
I teach Chinese.

28:47.330 --> 28:48.670
Oh, you're a teacher of No. 7 High School?

28:49.610 --> 28:51.780
My son graduated from No. 7 High School.

28:52.290 --> 28:53.530
I've heard about that.

28:53.570 --> 28:54.970
He's my junior.

28:55.130 --> 28:57.060
Several years below me.

28:57.320 --> 28:58.810
So you didn't teach him, did you?

29:00.280 --> 29:01.510
When he graduated,

29:01.510 --> 29:02.750
I was still in college.

29:02.750 --> 29:03.800
I didn't get to teach him.

29:11.550 --> 29:14.510
I heard you're a master of Huaiyang cuisine.

29:15.870 --> 29:18.060
I'm no master, just a cook.

29:31.230 --> 29:31.990
Well,

29:32.550 --> 29:35.080
what do you usually like to eat?

29:35.890 --> 29:37.050
Well,

29:37.080 --> 29:38.310
I'm not picky about food.

29:38.470 --> 29:39.640
Anything is fine.

29:39.680 --> 29:41.910
I don't cook at home a lot.

29:41.930 --> 29:44.950
When I'm hungry, I'll just go for some quick-frozen products. It's very convenient.

29:50.630 --> 29:53.730
I've heard that chefs don't like to cook at home.

29:53.850 --> 29:54.540
That's right.

29:55.670 --> 29:58.190
We've already worked all day in the kitchen.

29:58.220 --> 29:59.970
When we get home, we'd like to do nothing.

30:01.130 --> 30:02.370
Me too.

30:02.390 --> 30:03.270
After work,

30:03.300 --> 30:04.410
I just want to go home

30:04.440 --> 30:06.960
and spend the whole evening scrolling on my phone.

30:06.990 --> 30:09.270
Our generation is particularly fond of staying at home.

30:09.400 --> 30:10.230
Indeed.

30:11.180 --> 30:11.890
You know what?

30:11.930 --> 30:13.930
You're actually very similar to my son.

30:14.090 --> 30:14.670
Really?

30:14.710 --> 30:15.700
He's just like that.

30:15.720 --> 30:16.920
Give him a computer,

30:16.950 --> 30:18.540
and he won't leave the house for a month.

30:20.560 --> 30:23.030
So does your son have a girlfriend?

30:24.750 --> 30:27.240
No, I mean,

30:27.320 --> 30:29.520
homebodies are usually single.

30:29.580 --> 30:31.870
They've gotten used to and enjoy

30:31.890 --> 30:33.170
the solitude of being single.

30:34.060 --> 30:36.470
He's not single, actually.

30:36.720 --> 30:37.890
But

30:40.110 --> 30:42.090
I'm curious, do you think homebodies

30:42.130 --> 30:42.770
would

30:43.390 --> 30:44.390
want to get married?

30:44.410 --> 30:45.740
No, they wouldn't.

30:45.770 --> 30:48.920
They feel so free and happy being on their own.

30:48.940 --> 30:50.750
Why would they want someone to control them?

30:50.780 --> 30:52.660
Staying at home, eating snacks,

30:52.680 --> 30:54.230
reading books, watching shows,

30:54.360 --> 30:56.900
and browsing websites... Isn't that nice?

30:57.150 --> 30:58.540
Mr. Zhou, Mr. Zhou.

30:58.570 --> 30:59.720
Don't go in yet.

31:00.110 --> 31:02.010
Boss Zhou is having a blind date in there.

31:04.640 --> 31:07.070
I mean homebodies, not myself.

31:07.090 --> 31:08.670
I know. I know.

31:09.140 --> 31:12.960
What do you think these kids are thinking about all day?

31:14.390 --> 31:17.440
Her appearance is pretty good.

31:17.470 --> 31:18.380
Definitely.

31:18.460 --> 31:20.580
But isn't she a bit too young?

31:21.830 --> 31:24.090
Master Zhou doesn't look old either.

31:24.120 --> 31:25.410
And he's successful in his career.

31:25.430 --> 31:27.260
Besides, at his age,

31:27.300 --> 31:28.860
he knows how to care for women.

31:29.010 --> 31:30.090
There won't be any problem.

31:37.350 --> 31:39.430
At first, they were quite distant,

31:39.460 --> 31:42.250
but look how well they're chatting now.

31:45.070 --> 31:46.290
Not bad. Not bad.

31:46.330 --> 31:47.130
Right?

31:47.970 --> 31:48.710
I'll be off then.

31:48.710 --> 31:50.440
Alright, alright. Take care.

31:50.510 --> 31:51.230
No need to walk me any further.

31:51.270 --> 31:52.110
Goodbye.

31:52.110 --> 31:52.630
Okay.

31:56.860 --> 31:58.620
Alright, let's go.

32:00.330 --> 32:01.730
How was it? How do you feel?

32:01.760 --> 32:02.560
Pretty good.

32:04.780 --> 32:06.430
When's the next date?

32:06.590 --> 32:07.480
Next date...

32:08.510 --> 32:09.760
We didn't set one.

32:09.780 --> 32:10.610
You didn't?

32:10.650 --> 32:11.670
We didn't.

32:11.790 --> 32:13.590
I thought

32:13.760 --> 32:15.820
you two were getting along quite well.

32:15.840 --> 32:17.420
We did get along well.

32:17.440 --> 32:18.760
But the problem is

32:18.910 --> 32:21.110
she's from the same generation as Haikuo.

32:21.270 --> 32:22.540
Boss Zhou.

32:22.740 --> 32:25.090
Age isn't an issue.

32:25.110 --> 32:27.370
The key is to be like-minded.

32:27.390 --> 32:30.750
I think you two are quite suitable for each other.

32:30.770 --> 32:31.890
Wanghe's mom.

32:32.060 --> 32:35.310
You don't get to decide whether we're suitable or not.

32:36.220 --> 32:37.620
I'm the one who decides.

32:38.630 --> 32:40.690
Right? Alright, I'm getting to work.

32:44.440 --> 32:45.530
Aren't they suitable?

32:49.370 --> 32:53.750
[Fenghua Express]

32:55.200 --> 32:59.540
[Fenghua Express]

33:04.500 --> 33:05.540
What are you doing?

33:07.750 --> 33:08.900
How dare you steal packages?

33:08.930 --> 33:10.690
You want me to call the police?

33:10.720 --> 33:11.530
So?

33:11.890 --> 33:13.860
Who allowed you to deliver packages here?

33:13.890 --> 33:15.370
Who approved you?

33:21.310 --> 33:23.460
This is what you get for stealing my packages!

33:25.660 --> 33:28.440
I've been fed up with it.

33:28.500 --> 33:29.380
He's gone too far.

33:29.420 --> 33:30.490
He actually stole my packages.

33:30.520 --> 33:32.190
I rushed over and knocked him to the ground.

33:32.230 --> 33:34.700
What a jerk!

33:34.710 --> 33:36.600
Then he called a bunch of people there to help him.

33:36.630 --> 33:38.550
They didn't even know who they were messing with.

33:38.040 --> 33:42.050
[Fenghua Express]

33:38.580 --> 33:39.940
How could I be afraid of them?

33:39.980 --> 33:41.770
I'll beat him up every time I see him.

33:41.790 --> 33:42.350
What a joke.

33:42.420 --> 33:43.310
Enough.

33:43.330 --> 33:45.170
There are so many packages waiting to be delivered. Stop crowding around.

33:45.200 --> 33:45.880
Break it up. Break it up.

33:45.910 --> 33:46.950
Alright, let's go.

33:47.510 --> 33:48.630
Is he the one called Fourth Master?

33:48.680 --> 33:49.510
Next time we'll ambush him.

33:49.510 --> 33:49.950
Definitely.

33:50.030 --> 33:51.270
We'll beat him up every time we see him.

33:51.270 --> 33:52.370
We'll beat him up together.

33:52.430 --> 33:53.650
You're still not hurting enough.

33:55.910 --> 33:56.970
Let me handle this. You can get back to work.

33:56.990 --> 33:57.880
Okay.

34:05.400 --> 34:06.620
I-I-I'll do it myself.

34:06.800 --> 34:07.680
Stay put.

34:12.790 --> 34:13.429
It hurts.

34:14.940 --> 34:16.270
Who started the fight?

34:17.300 --> 34:18.900
They bullied us too badly.

34:18.909 --> 34:20.550
Anyone would lose their temper seeing their attitude.

34:20.929 --> 34:21.800
Exactly.

34:21.820 --> 34:23.260
Shuntong really went too far.

34:23.280 --> 34:25.179
Keyuan has always been our territory.

34:25.520 --> 34:26.760
Who do they think they are?

34:28.159 --> 34:29.480
Listen to yourself.

34:29.520 --> 34:32.280
Territory? You think we're gangsters?

34:32.290 --> 34:33.739
That's exactly what it is.

34:33.770 --> 34:35.120
We've been swallowing our anger.

34:35.139 --> 34:36.139
We've never messed with anyone,

34:36.190 --> 34:37.480
yet they insisted on fighting us.

34:37.710 --> 34:39.150
Once or twice is fine,

34:39.179 --> 34:41.460
but it never ends. They think we're just pushovers.

34:41.500 --> 34:43.510
That's right, Fenghua. They've been bullying us for a long time.

34:43.590 --> 34:45.760
Yes. They've gone too far.

34:45.780 --> 34:47.320
We can't let him off this time.

34:47.440 --> 34:49.280
If the police hadn't come in time today

34:49.320 --> 34:51.750
and prevented us from losing the packages, we'd be in big trouble.

34:54.090 --> 34:56.380
I've dealt with Mr. Wei from Shuntong before.

34:56.409 --> 34:57.380
He's alright.

34:57.810 --> 34:59.690
He's exactly the one behind them.

34:59.720 --> 35:01.390
Otherwise, he wouldn't have had the guts.

35:04.550 --> 35:05.450
Alright.

35:05.790 --> 35:07.220
I'll go meet him tomorrow.

35:08.150 --> 35:11.380
[Sorting Area]

35:12.590 --> 35:14.640
Shuntong's business is doing really well.

35:14.910 --> 35:16.370
In less than half an hour,

35:16.390 --> 35:18.100
they almost completed our daily volume.

35:18.130 --> 35:20.120
It's all stolen business. Shameless.

35:21.230 --> 35:22.740
Don't act like this later, okay?

35:22.780 --> 35:23.920
We're here to negotiate,

35:24.030 --> 35:25.250
not to pick a fight.

35:28.430 --> 35:30.330
[Shuntong Express]

35:29.420 --> 35:30.410
Mr. Wei.

35:30.440 --> 35:31.380
Long time no see.

35:35.240 --> 35:36.070
What?

35:36.540 --> 35:37.800
You took a big loss yesterday,

35:38.250 --> 35:39.820
and now you came to take revenge in person?

35:40.530 --> 35:41.840
We're friends.

35:41.870 --> 35:43.080
What revenge are you talking about?

35:43.110 --> 35:44.980
If there's any misunderstanding, why don't we just clear it up?

35:45.000 --> 35:46.590
Let's not waste each other's time when we could be making money.

35:48.140 --> 35:48.900
Okay.

35:49.380 --> 35:50.150
Go ahead.

35:50.970 --> 35:52.280
I'm here today

35:52.300 --> 35:53.740
to discuss with you

35:53.780 --> 35:55.380
the business scope of our two companies.

35:55.490 --> 35:57.100
I'm telling you.

35:57.120 --> 36:00.190
We entered Keyuan Nanli first.

36:00.220 --> 36:01.450
You didn't even give us a heads up

36:01.470 --> 36:02.960
before barging in to steal our territory. Is that appropriate?

36:02.990 --> 36:04.030
You're talking nonsense!

36:04.050 --> 36:05.250
It was us who entered here first.

36:05.290 --> 36:07.120
Who are you to talk?

36:07.170 --> 36:11.190
[Shuntong Express]

36:07.610 --> 36:09.540
Please calm down, Mr. Wei.

36:09.560 --> 36:11.530
It doesn't matter who entered here first.

36:11.540 --> 36:12.750
The business volume in this area is large enough

36:12.790 --> 36:13.970
for both our companies to thrive.

36:14.000 --> 36:15.810
There's no need to get so worked up.

36:15.820 --> 36:16.910
There's no need.

36:16.950 --> 36:18.340
Look, you've also been working in express delivery for a long time.

36:18.370 --> 36:19.750
You should know the rules, right?

36:19.780 --> 36:21.340
Territory is won with fists.

36:21.360 --> 36:23.080
Whoever has the stronger fist calls the shots.

36:23.320 --> 36:25.120
[Warehouse]

36:23.460 --> 36:24.630
We're delivering packages,

36:24.630 --> 36:25.410
not taking lives.

36:25.440 --> 36:26.300
We're entrepreneurs,

36:25.620 --> 36:26.770
[Warehouse]

36:26.330 --> 36:27.290
not thugs.

36:27.310 --> 36:28.350
Whether we're thugs or not,

36:28.390 --> 36:29.640
let's find out, shall we?

36:30.470 --> 36:31.530
Mr. Wei.

36:32.670 --> 36:33.630
Mr. Wei.

36:40.990 --> 36:42.210
I've told you,

36:42.240 --> 36:43.900
there's no reasoning with people like this.

36:50.260 --> 36:52.190
This is company policy.

36:52.230 --> 36:53.870
Mr. Xie demanded it this way.

36:53.910 --> 36:56.230
If you have any objections, go talk to him.

36:56.310 --> 36:57.990
If you have any complaints, go...

36:57.990 --> 36:58.990
Enough, stop asking.

36:58.990 --> 37:00.030
Hey.

37:00.030 --> 37:01.030
When he changed the rules,

37:01.030 --> 37:02.710
didn't you all applaud?

37:02.710 --> 37:05.060
Why don't you ask Mr. Xie why he changed it?

37:10.710 --> 37:11.950
What a commotion.

37:17.010 --> 37:18.240
What's wrong?

37:18.580 --> 37:19.730
Why are you making a scene here?

37:19.790 --> 37:20.310
When he told you that,

37:20.310 --> 37:22.060
you all joined in cheering, saying it was great.

37:22.060 --> 37:24.070
Now you should ask Mr. Xie. You must...

37:24.790 --> 37:27.030
Mr. Xie is here. Go ask him.

37:27.030 --> 37:27.790
Mr. Xie. Mr. Xie.

37:27.830 --> 37:28.790
Explain this.

37:28.830 --> 37:30.590
Why did the fines increase along with the commissions?

37:30.590 --> 37:32.110
Right, Mr. Xie.

37:32.110 --> 37:33.630
We only make such little money a day.

37:33.630 --> 37:34.390
With one fine,

37:34.430 --> 37:35.550
we've worked half a day for nothing.

37:35.580 --> 37:36.510
-That's right.
-That's bullying.

37:36.510 --> 37:37.950
There are so many of us

37:37.990 --> 37:38.990
and so many families to be fed.

37:39.010 --> 37:40.710
You can't be expecting to get rich

37:40.710 --> 37:41.840
with these fines, right?

37:41.840 --> 37:42.460
Exactly.

37:42.460 --> 37:43.110
Everyone.

37:43.130 --> 37:44.010
Everyone!

37:44.240 --> 37:45.690
Please listen to me first!

37:48.030 --> 37:50.210
Rewards and punishments go hand in hand.

37:50.240 --> 37:51.960
They complement each other.

37:51.980 --> 37:53.120
I've increased the commission,

37:53.460 --> 37:55.550
but the premise is to arrive on time.

37:55.550 --> 37:56.880
Did you manage to do that?

37:58.030 --> 37:59.620
If you can't accept it,

38:00.190 --> 38:01.290
let's not make any changes.

38:01.330 --> 38:04.530
We'll stick to the previous delivery time and commission rates.

38:04.750 --> 38:05.580
Do you want that?

38:07.550 --> 38:08.870
Mr. Xie.

38:08.910 --> 38:10.580
I think this blame

38:10.610 --> 38:12.030
shouldn't be put on everyone.

38:12.030 --> 38:12.550
Right?

38:12.550 --> 38:14.230
Yes, that's right.

38:15.030 --> 38:16.440
Don't be hasty!

38:17.750 --> 38:18.980
Mr. Xie knows

38:19.000 --> 38:20.320
why you couldn't deliver on time

38:20.360 --> 38:21.800
better than anyone.

38:21.820 --> 38:22.620
First,

38:22.660 --> 38:24.220
we haven't signed any agreements

38:24.240 --> 38:26.150
with the nearby restaurants, right?

38:26.190 --> 38:26.550
That's right.

38:26.550 --> 38:27.530
So the orders we can take

38:27.560 --> 38:28.850
are all several kilometers away.

38:28.870 --> 38:29.640
Second,

38:30.110 --> 38:31.210
the navigation system

38:31.270 --> 38:32.800
upgrade is full of bugs.

38:32.830 --> 38:35.390
We can't take the blame for that, can we?

38:35.420 --> 38:36.930
That's right.

38:42.510 --> 38:43.980
Alright. How about this?

38:45.510 --> 38:46.340
By the end of the month,

38:46.830 --> 38:47.910
we will secure

38:47.930 --> 38:49.730
all the neighborhoods within three kilometers to the east.

38:49.910 --> 38:50.670
As for the system,

38:50.690 --> 38:53.070
we'll also do a major upgrade as soon as possible.

38:53.670 --> 38:55.310
We guarantee that before it goes live,

38:55.340 --> 38:56.680
all faults will be eliminated.

38:56.800 --> 38:57.800
In return,

38:58.780 --> 39:00.310
I need you to promise me

39:00.920 --> 39:04.090
to reduce the overtime rate to 5%.

39:04.610 --> 39:05.650
Otherwise,

39:07.110 --> 39:08.630
the penalties will continue to increase.

39:10.630 --> 39:11.590
Mr. Xie!

39:11.910 --> 39:14.820
I want to ask you a question on behalf of everyone.

39:15.340 --> 39:16.710
If what you said

39:16.740 --> 39:18.420
can't deliver, what then?

39:18.450 --> 39:20.320
Exactly. Right.

39:20.570 --> 39:22.250
Then I'll cancel the penalties.

39:22.590 --> 39:23.860
If I can't do it,

39:24.070 --> 39:26.070
I have no right to make things difficult for you.

39:26.890 --> 39:30.110
Good, then it's a deal.

39:30.140 --> 39:32.220
Let's all wait and see.

39:32.240 --> 39:33.850
Let's give a big round of applause

39:33.880 --> 39:35.470
to cheer on Mr. Xie.

39:35.500 --> 39:37.350
Come on! Come on!

39:38.230 --> 39:38.990
Alright, alright.

39:39.030 --> 39:39.980
Everything has been made clear.

39:40.010 --> 39:41.080
Get back to work.

39:41.120 --> 39:41.950
Okay.

39:41.970 --> 39:43.660
If there's anything you don't understand,

39:43.690 --> 39:45.250
go ask Mr. Xie anytime.

39:45.270 --> 39:45.990
Get to work.

39:46.020 --> 39:46.430
Okay.

39:46.450 --> 39:48.440
Don't be afraid of causing trouble for Mr. Xie.

39:48.470 --> 39:51.080
Mr. Xie doesn't mind the trouble.

39:51.110 --> 39:52.120
Get to work.

39:52.250 --> 39:53.710
Thank you, Mr. Xie.

40:05.840 --> 40:07.200
What was that guy's intention?

40:13.590 --> 40:14.340
Sit.

40:14.830 --> 40:17.240
Why did he sound like he was picking a fight?

40:17.260 --> 40:18.700
Does he have a grudge against you?

40:19.070 --> 40:20.240
He's a local boss.

40:21.020 --> 40:23.300
He was in charge of this area before.

40:23.640 --> 40:25.540
I suddenly parachuted in,

40:25.810 --> 40:27.560
so it's understandable that he wants to give me a hard time.

40:27.910 --> 40:29.000
Why bother talking to him then?

40:29.030 --> 40:30.270
Just fire him.

40:30.310 --> 40:31.790
He didn't make any mistake.

40:31.990 --> 40:32.830
How can I just fire him?

40:33.240 --> 40:34.460
Contradicting his leader face to face

40:34.500 --> 40:35.220
and embarrassing you in front of the employees.

40:35.250 --> 40:36.480
Isn't that considered a mistake?

40:36.510 --> 40:38.230
I'd have given him a good slap if it were me.

40:38.260 --> 40:39.360
Don't be reckless.

40:40.870 --> 40:41.760
I was kidding.

40:43.580 --> 40:45.280
I just heard him say

40:45.720 --> 40:47.390
your system is full of glitches.

40:47.410 --> 40:49.340
Didn't you test it before going live?

40:49.600 --> 40:51.950
We did, but time was too tight.

40:52.190 --> 40:54.440
We didn't develop this navigation system.

40:54.460 --> 40:56.660
Every time the interface needs to be modified,

40:56.690 --> 40:58.220
we have to wait for the developer's response.

40:58.580 --> 41:00.060
There's not enough time.

41:01.600 --> 41:03.360
What's your plan?

41:04.280 --> 41:06.230
How should we divide the work among the three of us?

41:10.800 --> 41:12.400
[Deliver][Pick up][Delay][Delivery is about to be delayed]

41:11.010 --> 41:13.250
Xingchi, you're responsible for canvassing.

41:12.510 --> 41:13.140
[Ruyi Wontons]

41:13.380 --> 41:15.550
All the neighborhoods within three kilometers to the east

41:15.580 --> 41:16.630
are assigned to you.

41:16.650 --> 41:17.610
Haikuo.

41:17.700 --> 41:19.370
You're in charge of testing the system,

41:19.390 --> 41:20.150
finding bugs,

41:20.180 --> 41:21.270
and reporting back immediately.

41:21.360 --> 41:22.730
Canvassing?

41:22.940 --> 41:24.070
How do I do that?

41:24.110 --> 41:26.110
Canvassing means entering every door you see,

41:26.150 --> 41:27.030
starting talking as soon as you enter,

41:27.080 --> 41:28.220
and signing a contract as soon as you reach an agreement.

41:28.370 --> 41:29.420
Use any method you want.

41:30.240 --> 41:31.870
Let's talk on the phone anytime.

41:31.920 --> 41:32.470
Thank you.

41:32.470 --> 41:33.260
Goodbye.

41:33.390 --> 41:34.970
We're from Bee Delivery.

41:35.000 --> 41:36.760
We don't really need that. I'm sorry.

41:40.690 --> 41:42.150
Let me leave you a contact number...

41:42.180 --> 41:43.100
No need, no need.

41:43.120 --> 41:44.000
Please feel free to call me anytime

41:44.060 --> 41:45.060
if you're interested.

41:49.980 --> 41:51.130
Fix the bugs in this program

41:51.150 --> 41:52.990
as soon as possible after this.

41:58.790 --> 42:00.380
[Bee Delivery]

42:00.540 --> 42:02.480
[Questionnaire Survey on Job Satisfaction of Delivery Riders]

42:03.780 --> 42:04.430
Bro.

42:04.430 --> 42:05.340
What's up?

42:05.880 --> 42:08.320
I'm from the Haidian branch

42:08.830 --> 42:09.840
of Bee Delivery.

42:08.930 --> 42:10.240
[Questionnaire Survey on Job Satisfaction of Delivery Riders]

42:09.880 --> 42:11.680
Could you please fill out this questionnaire for me?

42:11.710 --> 42:13.810
Alright, thank you.

42:13.460 --> 42:15.320
[There have always been missing and wrong orders]

42:13.460 --> 42:15.320
[There's always a delay at the back end after placing an order]

42:15.720 --> 42:17.500
These three points are what we've summarized.

42:17.530 --> 42:18.750
And these questionnaires.

42:18.790 --> 42:20.150
These are just a few crucial points.

42:20.190 --> 42:22.470
Our self-developed map needs to be done quickly. As soon as possible.

42:22.510 --> 42:24.590
-What day is it today?
-It's Tuesday.
-By Thursday.

42:24.590 --> 42:26.270
Before Thursday, we must

42:26.310 --> 42:28.150
conduct the third round of testing.

42:28.190 --> 42:28.870
Thank you.

42:28.910 --> 42:29.640
Thank you.

42:29.660 --> 42:31.000
Thank you.

42:31.030 --> 42:31.790
Done, right?

42:38.580 --> 42:42.570
[Deliver][Pick up][Delay][Delivery is about to be delayed]

42:42.590 --> 42:44.360
[Deliver][Pick up][Delay][Delivery is about to be delayed]

42:46.870 --> 42:53.760
[Deliver][Pick up][Delay][Delivery is about to be delayed]

42:56.910 --> 42:58.970
Go find out about the current situation

42:58.990 --> 43:00.160
of Haidian branch.
